the same shell, but are usefull for keeping something on your screen
while doing something in another window. It also sets up and activates
your "SYS PF" keys to let you switch windows, and quit. The window sizes
and locations can easily be modifed if you have a 4425 manual. If anyone
has real interrest utilities for these terminals, I have lots.

